cy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-08-02T07:32:34Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T19:25:32Z","closed_at":"2025-08-24T19:25:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproductible in: v4.5.beta4.official [2d113cc22]\n- Reproductible in: v4.5.beta3.official [4d1f26e1f]\n- Reproductible in: v4.5.beta2.official [e1b4101e3]\n- Not reproductible in: v4.5.beta1.official [46c495ca2]\n- Not reproductible in: v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta4 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7680) - AMD Ryzen 7 2700X Eight-Core Processor (16 threads) - 31.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nOn a standard (default parameters) web export, clicking a mouse button while holding the other one doesn't register the latest clicked. Tested with actions or listening to ```Input.is_mouse_button_pressed```.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSimply have ```print(Input.get_mouse_button_mask())``` in a ```_process``` function and see it never display \"3\", which should be the mask for holding both mouse buttons at the same time. It displays either \"1\" or \"2\" depending on either the left or right mouse buttons are held first.\n\nTested on Chrome and Firefox and the issue is happening on both.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSimply have ```print(Input.get_mouse_button_mask())``` in a ```_process``` function, but here are examples:\n\nProject: [mouse-test-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21557342/mouse-test-project.zip)\nWeb exported files: [MouseTestProjectExport.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21557351/MouseTestProjectExport.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109226/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109226/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}